### formatFullModeContext (lines 298-384)
Used in `--full` task list mode. Shows `Depends on:` line at line 380:
```typescript
if (task.depends_on && task.depends_on.length > 0) {
  console.log(chalk.gray(`${indent}Depends on: ${task.depends_on.join(", ")}`));
}
```

### formatTaskList / formatTaskListWithAutomation (lines 481-476)
Both call `formatTask` per item, then optionally `formatFullModeContext`.

